# Lumaret's Favor: Infusion -- the trigger checks life gained as it resolves, not as the spell is cast. Bot1 casts it at its own
# Grizzly Bears with no life gained, then answers its own trigger with Lightning Helix (3 life). The Helix resolves first, so
# the trigger copies the Favor, and the copy takes a new target, Bot2's Grizzly Bears. Both are 4/6 until end of turn. The copy
# is not cast, so nothing else triggers: two Favors resolve, one is a card in the graveyard.

